dy (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8wBEye516IKul9sW7JKGcFXVGfV.jpg"},{"name":"Men in Black: International","year":2019,"character":"Agent M","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dPrUPFcgLfNbmDL8V69vcrTyEfb.jpg"},{"name":"Between Two Ferns: The Movie","year":2019,"character":"Tessa Thompson","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cHxc8v1GkzdjjhF2qnpG6wdXrOT.jpg"},{"name":"Avengers: Endgame","year":2019,"character":"Valkyrie","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jtDv3lCnST0fZRvdYFwR5CVwK2x.jpg","characterFa":"والکری"},{"name":"Shadow Stalker","year":2019,"character":"Tessa Thompson","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/liEAIaE448r7YPwTwF22D6BSnBQ.jpg"},{"name":"Brave Girl Rising","year":2019,"character":"Nasro (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pq26JqCeMFVCB3sji8aM8sBAWGE.jpg"},{"name":"Annihilation","year":2018,"character":"Josie Radek","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4YRplSk6BhH6PRuE9gfyw9byUJ6.jpg"},{"name":"Sorry to Bother You","year":2018,"character":"Detroit","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/peTl1V04E9ppvhgvNmSX0r2ALqO.jpg"},{"name":"Creed II","year":2018,"character":"Bianca","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/v3QyboWRoA4O9RbcsqH8tJMe8EB.jpg"},{"name":"Furlough","year":2018,"character":"Nicole Stevens","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cw1RkjmbNfIbujkPGh6a8J9Lrf1.jpg"},{"name":"Dirty Computer","year":2018,"character":"Zen","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/s0DmUmSXuQmlHq83OsX0g13blaK.jpg"},{"name":"Thor: Ragnarok","year":2017,"character":"Valkyrie","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rzRwTcFvttcN1ZpX2xv4j3tSdJu.jpg","characterFa":"والکری"},{"name":"South Dakota","year":2017,"character":"Chris","mediaType":"movie","poster":"http